    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2P1JQ9UqE1vsw1UwgGCi9aM)_\n\nAdds two built-in columns to `sp-collection-query-tables`:\n\n- `:refs` shows the `ROAM_REFS` property (a property, not Vulpea meta, so a plain string column could not reach it).\n- `:pdf` reads the citation keys in `ROAM_REFS` (`@key` or `cite:key`) and shows the files `citar-get-files` finds, as `[[file:...]]` links (empty without a file).\n\nExample: `#+BEGIN: collection-query-table :tags (\"litnote\") :columns (:title :refs :pdf)`\n\nEdited in the doc and in `sp-collection-query-tables-core.el` (tangle by hand: no Emacs in the container, so the tangle check and the new test in `tests/sp-collection-query-tables-test.el` were not run). The PDF comes from the local library only; a DEVONthink link is not included.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8q9zwVhMybYWXqYXq)_",
